     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_lishtatef_im_hatzibbur",
     "gloss_en": "Abaye: always a person should join himself with the congregation"
    }
   ]
  },
  "2": {
   "segId": "Berakhot.30a.3",
   "sugya": "berakhot_29b_tefillat_haderech",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_mehiyot_tov",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "מהיות טוב אל תקרא רע",
     "supports": "p_okman_lediddi",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rav_chisda_kam_umtzalei",
     "gloss_en": "Rav Chisda, walking on the road with Rav Sheshet, stood and prayed (the narrator; and the attendant: he is standing and praying)"
    }
   ]
  },
  "1": {
   "segId": "Berakhot.30a.2",
   "sugya": "berakhot_29b_tefillat_haderech",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_mishaa_shemehalech",
     "gloss_en": "Rav Chisda: [when does he pray it?] from the time he walks on the road"
    }
   ]
  },
  "3": {
   "segId": "Berakhot.30a.4",
   "sugya": "berakhot_29b_tefillat_haderech",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_havinenu_shalosh",
     "gloss_en": "havinenu: he must pray the first three and the last three [blessings]"
    }
   ]
  },
  "4": {
   "segId": "Berakhot.30a.5",
   "sugya": "berakhot_29b_tefillat_haderech",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_hilcheta_havinenu_meumad",
     "gloss_en": "the halakha: havinenu -- standing"
    }
   ]
  },
  "5": {
   "segId": "Berakhot.30a.6",
   "sugya": "berakhot_30a_halakha_kerebbi_rochev",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rochev_yesh_lo_mi_sheyochez",
     "gloss_en": "the first tanna: one riding a donkey when the time for prayer arrived -- if he has someone to hold his donkey, he dismounts and prays; if not, he sits in his place and prays"
    },
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_lefi_sheein_daato",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "לפי שאין דעתו מיושבת עליו -- Rebbi's own reason for his ruling",
     "supports": "p_rebbi_yesh_lo_yeshev",
     "status": "live"
    }
   ]
  },
  "6": {
   "segId": "Berakhot.30a.7",
   "sugya": "berakhot_30a_halakha_kerebbi_rochev",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_halakha_kerebbi_rochev",
     "gloss_en": "Rava (and some say R' Yehoshua ben Levi): the halakha follows Rebbi"
    }
   ]
  },
  "11": {
   "segId": "Berakhot.30a.12",
   "sugya": "berakhot_30a_hishkim_laderech",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_kmaan_kihai_tanna",
     "kind": "tanya_kevatei",
     "gloss_en": "כמאן? כי האי תנא, דתניא: ...השכים לישב בקרון או בספינה מתפלל, וכשיגיע זמן קריאת שמע קורא",
     "supports": "p_avuha_dishmuel_velevi_mekadmi",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_hishkim_latzet_laderech",
     "gloss_en": "one who rose early to set out on the road: they bring him a shofar and he blows, a lulav and he shakes it, a megilla and he reads it, and when the time for Shema arrives he recites it"
    }
   ]
  },
  "12": {
   "segId": "Berakhot.30a.13",
   "sugya": "berakhot_30a_hishkim_laderech",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_rsbe_kdei_sheyismoch",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "כדי שיסמוך גאולה לתפלה",
     "supports": "p_rsbe_korei_umitpallel",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rsbe_korei_umitpallel",
     "gloss_en": "R' Shimon ben Elazar: either way he recites Shema and [then] prays"
    }
   ]
  },
  "13": {
   "segId": "Berakhot.30a.14",
   "sugya": "berakhot_30a_hishkim_laderech",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_tefilla_meumad_adif",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "מר סבר תפלה מעומד עדיף -- one master holds prayer standing is preferable",
     "supports": "p_hishkim_bakaron_mitpallel",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_semichat_geula_adif",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "ומר סבר מסמך גאולה לתפלה עדיף",
     "supports": "p_rsbe_korei_umitpallel",
     "status": "live"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_tefilla_meumad_adif",
     "gloss_en": "one master holds that prayer standing is preferable"
    }
   ]
  },
  "15": {
   "segId": "Berakhot.30a.16",
   "sugya": "berakhot_30a_hishkim_laderech",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_laavid_mar_kemareimar",
     "kind": "maaseh",
     "gloss_en": "ולעביד מר כמרימר ומר זוטרא! -- let the Master do as Mareimar and Mar Zutra [gather ten and pray before the lecture]",
     "against": "p_rav_ashi_mitzalei_meyushav",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "ans_tricha_li_milta",
     "gloss_en": "טריחא לי מלתא -- it is burdensome to me",
     "answers": "obj_laavid_mar_kemareimar",
     "restores": "p_rav_ashi_mitzalei_meyushav"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection",
     "object": "obj_laavid_mar_keavuha_dishmuel",
     "kind": "maaseh",
     "gloss_en": "ולעביד מר כאבוה דשמואל ולוי! -- let the Master do as Shmuel's father and Levi [pray early]",
     "against": "p_rav_ashi_mitzalei_meyushav",
     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "ans_lo_chazina_rabbanan_kashishei",
     "gloss_en": "לא חזינא להו לרבנן קשישי מינן דעבדי הכי -- I have not seen Sages older than us who do so",
     "answers": "obj_laavid_mar_keavuha_dishmuel",
     "restores": "p_rav_ashi_mitzalei_meyushav"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rav_ashi_mitzalei_meyushav",
     "gloss_en": "Rav Ashi would pray with the congregation as an individual, seated; when he came home he would pray again, standing"
    }
   ]
  },
  "10": {
   "segId": "Berakhot.30a.11",
   "sugya": "berakhot_30a_hishkim_laderech",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_avuha_dishmuel_velevi_mekadmi",
     "gloss_en": "Shmuel's father and Levi, when they wished to set out on the road, would pray early, and when the time for Shema arrived they recited it"
    }
   ]
  },
  "14": {
   "segId": "Berakhot.30a.15",
   "sugya": "berakhot_30a_hishkim_laderech",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_mareimar_mar_zutra_mechanfi",
     "gloss_en": "Mareimar and Mar Zutra would gather ten on the Shabbat of the festival and pray, and then go out to the lecture"
    }
   ]
  },
